  <!--
    FACE_OPTOUT_REPAIR_ONLY_AT_HOME. Facial Animation (Nals, workshop 1635901197) draws its anime face on every Human
    unless the race-xenotype key is ticked off in ITS OWN settings file (IgnoreEnableAnimationForRaceXenoTypeListAA);
    it reads no def, extension or patchable XML. So the opt-out ships here as data, and Source/RSW_FacialAnimationOptOut.cs
    postfixes FacialAnimationModSettings.ShouldDrawRaceXenoType to return false for these xenotypes. Without FA the
    postfix is never applied (its Prepare finds no target) and this def is inert.
    The list is the owner's 68 Human-RSW_* entries (his 2026-10-19 config) plus Sith Kissai, which wears an RSW_ head and
    was missing there. RSW_MandrakeJawa and RSW_Jawa_Xeno_Gamorrean wear vanilla heads and are NOT listed: adding them
    would change how they look today (cosmetic; owner question).
    Coverage of every xenotype in src/ that wears an RSW_ HeadTypeDef is held by selftest_fa_optout.py.
  -->
